  "title": "Trackstraps for VIVE Ultimate Tracker",
  "handle": "21048455",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"main-product-description py-3\">\n<p>Keep your VIVE Ultimate Trackers<sup>1</sup><span> </span>secured in place with TrackStraps by Rebuff Reality. Breathable elastic neoprene, comfortable and firm. Fits most waist sizes and foot and shoe sizes. Supports full-body tracking in VR games and applications.</p>\n<p>The Dance Dash Game Key can be redeemed for one (1) copy of Dance Dash on VIVEPORT. Instructions for redeeming the game are printed on the game key card. Morph your VR rig into the ultimate dance floor and use your feet to stomp the beats in this pulse-pounding, full-body sensory symphony!</p>\n<p>Includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Left TrackStrap for VIVE Ultimate Tracker</li>\n<li>Right TrackStrap for VIVE Ultimate Tracker</li>\n<li>TrackStrap Belt for VIVE Ultimate Tracker</li>\n<li>Dance Dash Game Key</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"main-product-description py-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"txt-disclaimer\">1. VIVE Ultimate Trackers sold separately.</div>",
